@base <https://www.w3.org/ns/posix/stat.rdf>.

@prefix rdf: <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#>.
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#>.
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#>.
@prefix xml: <http://www.w3.org/XML/1998/namespace>.

<https://www.w3.org/ns/posix/stat.rdf#atime> rdfs:comment "time of last access".
<https://www.w3.org/ns/posix/stat.rdf#blksize> rdfs:comment "blocksize for file system I/O".
<https://www.w3.org/ns/posix/stat.rdf#blocks> rdfs:comment "number of 512B blocks allocated".
<https://www.w3.org/ns/posix/stat.rdf#ctime> rdfs:comment "time of last status change".
<https://www.w3.org/ns/posix/stat.rdf#dev> rdfs:comment "ID of device containing file".
<https://www.w3.org/ns/posix/stat.rdf#gid> rdfs:comment "group ID of owner".
<https://www.w3.org/ns/posix/stat.rdf#ino> rdfs:comment "inode number".
<https://www.w3.org/ns/posix/stat.rdf#mode> rdfs:comment "protection".
<https://www.w3.org/ns/posix/stat.rdf#mtime> rdfs:comment "time of last modification".
<https://www.w3.org/ns/posix/stat.rdf#nlink> rdfs:comment "number of hard links".
<https://www.w3.org/ns/posix/stat.rdf#rdev> rdfs:comment "device ID (if special file)".
<https://www.w3.org/ns/posix/stat.rdf#size> rdfs:comment "total size, in bytes".
<https://www.w3.org/ns/posix/stat.rdf#uid> rdfs:comment "user ID of owner".
